{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達周四任命其長期擔任首席財務官的科萊特·克雷斯（Colette Kress）為臨時行政總裁。前任CEO黃仁勳的突然辭職引發了一場充滿不確定性的巨大風暴，這一任命將迫使這位財務老將帶領公司穿越這場危機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586114.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:04:19.449729+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:37:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:57:33.699928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:57:33.699928+00:00","content_hash":"c3dff3156ee25085be21ba14628220860ea55a502a0800843bc3e9ab4901199c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}